OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipes leave homes and
OL,4,Aschools without water
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes and businesses in North
OL,7,FLincolnshire have been left without
OL,8,Fwater due to burst pipes overnight.
OL,10,FA number of schools have been closed
OL,11,Ffor the day, including John Leggott
OL,12,FCollege, Messingham Primary School, St
OL,13,FHugh's School and St. Bernadette's
OL,14,FCatholic Primary Voluntary Academy.
OL,16,FAnglian Water said while teams were
OL,17,Ffixing a pipe in the Scunthorpe area, a
OL,18,Fsecond pipe also burst, which
OL,19,Ftemporarily stopped water flowing into
OL,20,Fthe local reservoir and caused it to
OL,21,Fempty.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
