OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipes leave homes and
OL,4,Aschools without water
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the first pipe has been
OL,7,Ftemporarily repaired and water is
OL,8,Fflowing back into the network, and work
OL,9,Fcontinues on the second pipe to restore
OL,10,Fsupplies.
